Post-task reflection: a newly written reflection reads the transport receipts the host already keeps, for
a lineage its own canonical task-results walk finds after admission (never the child evidence deciding it),
in a captured window anchored on recorded starts or limited without one, with labelled bindings, disclosed
coverage, clipped values with counted omissions and the whole selection retained for the reflection's
read_file; why it is episodic evidence and adds no store or wait.
